    "body": "I think a detached `iframe` should cause the `Window` to clear the state to prevent any abuse.  Imagine a malicious site swapping an `iframe` only to utilize one origin's user activation state in a different origin---@marcoscaceres: I guess this is what you wanted a \"protection\" against?\r\n\r\nI don't know if some navigation-related algorithm already handles this state reset.",
