    "body": "I just approved the PR because it matches the spec text.  But I think the spec should require deactivating the user activation state when a `Window` is detached, to prevent any possibility of deliberate double consumption (see my comment [here](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/36684#discussion_r1012172703)).\r\n\r\nThanks for spotting this!\r\n\r\nFor records, this comment from @annevk seems related: https://github.com/WICG/capability-delegation/issues/22\r\n",
